  "title": "Neonode Set to Join Russell 2000® Index",
  "summary": "STOCKHOLM, SWEDEN, June 3, 2025 — Neonode Inc. (NASDAQ: NEON) (the “Company” or “Neonode”) will be added as a member of the U.S. small-cap Russell 2000 Index, effective after the U.S. market opens on June 30 as part of the 2025 Russell indexes reconstitution. Neonode, a provider of touch technology",
